    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271569</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>協力しますか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Help him?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269996</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おお、おおおお！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ooh, oooooh!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269996</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おぬしのような若者を
探していたんじゃ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I've been looking for
some young'uns like you!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269996</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうじゃ？　ちとこの老いぼれに
協力してくれんかの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>How about it? Will you
help this old fool a mite?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270188</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうかそうか。
まずは自己紹介じゃ。
わしはサーウー・ギスキーという</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I see, I see. Well, let's
start with the introductions.
I'm Rabb I. Tolliver.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270188</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>名前のとおりウサギ好きでのー
ウサギを愛でるギルド
ラブリーうさギルドの代表じゃ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Like my name suggests, I love rabbits!
In fact, I'm the representative for a guild
just for admiring them, the Bunny Guild.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270232</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ぎるど？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Guild?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270328</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まあ、仲間って言うか
組合って言うか。
チームみたいなもんだね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, it's like they're comrades,
or members of a society...
Or just like, you know, a team.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270680</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうそう。それじゃ。
おねいさん、詳しいのう。
で、わしのギルドじゃが</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's about right. You really
know a lot, don'tcha, love!
But anyway, about my guild...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270680</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まだ会員数が少なくてのう……
この前、ぶれーぶなんとかとかいう
ギルドに宣伝してもらったんじゃが</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We've not got a lot of members... A
little while back, this guild, Brave
something-or-other, advertised for us, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270680</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>会員数を１０人にしてもらって、
廃ギルドの危機を脱しただけに
過ぎんのじゃ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They helped us get up to ten members,
so's our guild won't be struck
off, but that's as far as they went.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270680</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そこで！お前さんたちにも
我がギルドの宣伝を
してもらいたいんじゃよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And so! I was hopin' you
lot would help advertise
for my guild, too!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>270764</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いいけど……具体的には
どう宣伝すればいいんだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Uh, sure...but how should
we advertise, exactly?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271172</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうさのう……
この世界には珍しい、
精霊という存在がいると聞く</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, good question... Well, I've heard
that in this world, there's these
rare entities. Spirits, they call them.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271172</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>その精霊を使役できるほどに
強ければ、その名声も自然と
世の中に広まるじゃろう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I figure if you're strong enough
to use those spirits, you'll get
famous throughout the world.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271172</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そこで！お前さんたちは今から
うさギルド特別広報として
精霊たちと契約していってほしい！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And so! As a special assignment from
the Bunny Guild, I want you to go out
and form pacts with those spirits!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271172</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さすれば我がギルドも有名に
なっていく、という寸法じゃ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If you do that, my guild should get
pretty famous, too! And that's the plan!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271172</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もちろん成果が出次第、
それに応じて報酬は出す！
どうじゃ？頼まれてくれんかの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And I'll reward you according
to your results, too! How about
it? Can you do it for me?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>4</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271232</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>困った人を助けるのが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Helping those who are struggling...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271288</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なりきり士の仕事、だね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...is a Roleplayer's job!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271408</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おうおう、受けてくれるか！
ありがたい。では各地の
精霊との契約、頼んだぞい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oooh, so you'll do it! Thank you
kindly. Then, I'll let you go around
and make pacts with those spirits!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271532</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>トホホ……　今なら
ダイナミックキャンペーンにつき
大変おトクじゃったのじゃが</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ohoho... Well, right now, they're
offering some mighty fine deals
as part of their Dynamic Campaign...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
